Project Overview
Tender Wings Home is a web-based platform designed to manage donations, caregivers, and beneficiaries for a charitable organization. It includes:

Admin Panel (for managing users and donations)

Caregiver Interface (for managing beneficiaries)

Donor Portal (for making donations and tracking contributions)

Built with:

Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Bootstrap

Backend: PHP, MySQL

Server: XAMPP (Apache & MySQL)

Project Setup

Place the project folder in htdocs (e.g., C:\xampp\htdocs\tenderwings.com)

Import the database (.sql file) via phpMyAdmin

Access the Project

Open browser and go to:

http://localhost/tenderwings.com/

