How to Create New Users (Admin Panel)
Log in as Admin

Navigate to Users → Add New

Fill in details (email, password, role)

Click Save

Roles Available:

Admin (Full access)

Caregiver (Limited to beneficiary management)

Donor (Can donate & view history)

Database Structure (MySQL)
Key Tables:

users 
donations 
children
health records
incidents
inventory
tasks